      "en": "He entered again into the synagogue, and there was a man there whose hand was withered.",
      "ko": "예수께서 다시 회당에 들어가시니 한편 손 마른 사람이 거기 있는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "e7636760924721205aa9f248f79c5e61933ca560511459f73e2848b9fd371960",
      "translation_text_hash": "4188d33e7cc0b64385486e25669b23280faabc0d03d9dfd1aaabe829ba24eb9e",
