      "en": "They watched him, whether he would heal him on the Sabbath day, that they might accuse him.",
      "ko": "사람들이 예수를 송사하려 하여 안식일에 그 사람을 고치시는가 엿보거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "2b35360d9dc50c0c657128e714b0b8e575343e7575dac7b7b9cc5cc4cf1d3470",
      "translation_text_hash": "c0f90350249c6e93e5f3747e5167f9fc13f1b35735b7b6392a3b9ab4d9526fcc",
