      "en": "He said to the man whose hand was withered, “Stand up.”",
      "ko": "예수께서 손 마른 사람에게 이르시되 한 가운데 일어서라 하시고",
      "source_text_hash": "c38aed4fabb2e417e291bb4ee068cb888b4b7c5257bb47fe80164b8ec555c534",
      "translation_text_hash": "1fc48c45f8c5024fee9da4e6e183eb100b0c4b7c3e8ba4bb46aaf8fc20a695ca",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "예수께서 손 마른 사람에게 이르시되 한 가운데 일어서라 하시고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1fc48c45f8c5024fee9da4e6e183eb100b0c4b7c3e8ba4bb46aaf8fc20a695ca"
      ]
