      "en": "Jesus withdrew to the sea with his disciples; and a great multitude followed him from Galilee, from Judea,",
      "ko": "예수께서 제자들과 함께 바다로 물러가시니 갈릴리에서 큰 무리가 좇으며",
      "source_text_hash": "4de1ded8762619834a4725569dc8503feda7fb0ab65feaf82f42a4535e9ecf69",
      "translation_text_hash": "04cf21c77448d695dba38151673cb2dfb026b1f8ef497bb347d027013c0ecf07",
