      "en": "For he had healed many, so that as many as had diseases pressed on him that they might touch him.",
      "ko": "이는 많은 사람을 고치셨으므로 병에 고생하는 자들이 예수를 만지고자 하여 핍근히 함이더라",
      "source_text_hash": "cb2464d8c400048e76997f96ea1d9702f6c2a80dc6cad253d2e039d15c3ee6ac",
      "translation_text_hash": "b1dc8fe17a258041524d0b8c93859c44403ca12f9b8158cec63dac9ee8a68021",
